"            <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px 0; color:#52606d; font-size:14px; line-height:22px;\">\n"
"                您的教练已完成您的健康评估。\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse; border:1pxsolid #e6e6e6; border-radius:6px; Overflow:hidden;\">\n"
"                <tr style=\"background-color:#f9f9fb;\">\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f2933; width:45%;\">评估参考</td>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#52606d;\"><t t-out=\"object.name\"/></td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"                <tr>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f2933;\">日期</td>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#52606d;\"><t t-out=\"format_date(object.date)\"/></td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"                <tr style=\"background-color:#f9f9fb;\">\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f2933;\">高度</td>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#52606d;\"><t t-out=\"object.height_cm\"/> 厘米</td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"                <tr>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f2933;\">粗细</td>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#52606d;\"><t t-out=\"object.weight_kg\"/> 公斤</td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"                <tr style=\"background-color:#f9f9fb;\">\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f2933;\">BMI</td>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#52606d;\"><t t-out=\"object.bmi\"/></td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"                <tr>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f2933;\">健身目标</td>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#52606d;\"><t t-out=\"object.goal\"/></td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"                <t t-if=\"object.trainer_id\">\n"
"                    <tr style=\"background-color:#f9f9fb;\">\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; color:#1f2933;\">训练器</td>\n"
"                        <td style=\"padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; color:#52606d;\"><t t-out=\"object.trainer_id.name\"/></td>\n"
"                    </tr>\n"
"                </t>\n"
"            </表>\n"
"            <p style=\"margin:24px 0 0 0; color:#52606d; font-size:14px; line-height:22px;\">\n"
"                您的教练将利用这些结果为您设计个性化的锻炼和饮食计划。\n"
"            </p>\n"
"        </td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"    <tr>\n"
"        <td style=\"background-color:#f9f9fb; padding:16px 32px; text-align:center; border-top:1px Solid #e6e6e6;\">\n"
"            <span style=\"color:#9aa5b1; font-size:12px;\"><t t-out=\"user.company_id.name\"/> 健身房管理团队</span>\n"
"        </td>\n"
"    </tr>\n"
"</表>\n"
"</td></tr>\n"
"</表>"

